      "  [BIN] MLP                        train_acc=0.676  val_acc=0.514  val_f1=0.578  test_acc=0.503  precision=0.511  recall=0.550  f1=0.530  roc_auc=0.506  mae=0.497  mape=24596.385  brier=0.303\n"
